<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE II: </span>Ablation studies: conditioning FoleyGRAM with all modalities (AVT), audio and video (AV), audio and text (AT), video and text (VT), audio (A), video (V) and text (T) modalities. For all the experiments, the conditioning modalities are the ground truth samples, even though at inference time any kind of sample can be used to condition the semantics of the waveforms.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Conditionings</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FAD-C <math id="S4.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th>
